  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:fly",
    "edge:wing>fly",
    "focus:fly"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "扇动翅膀，就能飞："
    },
    {
     "en": "fly"
    },
    {
     "en": "My pet bird can fly."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:tail",
    "edge:wing>tail",
    "focus:tail"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "鸟、猫、狗，都有尾巴："
